{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09453","headline":"述园鹿 · 韦应物","name":"述园鹿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野性本难畜，翫习亦逾年。\n麑班始力直，麚角已苍然。\n仰首嚼园柳，俯身饮清泉。\n见人若闲暇，蹶起忽低骞。\n兹兽有高貌，凡类宁比肩。\n不得游山泽，局促诚可怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}